  "remarks": "M Leasing LLC is a Russian shipping company providing logistical support to the Ministry of Defence of the Russian Federation. In particular, M Leasing LLC is involved in a military transportation network of Russian cargo vessels shipping North Korean armaments from Pyongyang to military facilities in the Russian port of Dunai. Subsequently, North Korean munitions transported by M Leasing LLC are transferred to a munitions depot in the town of Tikhoretsk on Russia’s western border to be deployed in Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine.",
